{"id":"04875e321b3948c5","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-measure8-joining-measure.md","title":"ZFC Measure8 Joining Measure","display":"df-zfc-measure8-joining-measure — ZFC Measure8 Joining Measure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure8-joining-measure","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure8-joining-measure"],"display":"df-zfc-measure8-joining-measure — ZFC Measure8 Joining Measure","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-joining]]","[[58-df-measure-space]]","[[58-df-zfc-measure5-measure-preserving-map]]","[[58-df-zfc-prob-product-sigma-algebra]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure8-joining-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure8-joining-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure8-joining-measure — ZFC Measure8 Joining Measure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4a3373ca17fc93e6\" href=\"?note=4a3373ca17fc93e6\" title=\"58-df-joining\">58-df-joining</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"58-df-measure-space\">58-df-measure-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e3a691aa8eb9a794\" href=\"?note=e3a691aa8eb9a794\" title=\"58-df-zfc-measure5-measure-preserving-map\">58-df-zfc-measure5-measure-preserving-map</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8c2a1f4e68d8efc8\" href=\"?note=8c2a1f4e68d8efc8\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob-product-sigma-algebra\">58-df-zfc-prob-product-sigma-algebra</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in V\">\\(X,Y\\in V\\)</span> (measure-space carriers)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal P(Y)\">\\(\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal P(Y)\\)</span> (sigma algebras)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu,\\nu\">\\(\\mu,\\nu\\)</span> (probability measures on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> (candidate joining measure on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\times Y\">\\(X\\times Y\\)</span>) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> (product sigma-algebra witness).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T:X\\to X\">\\(T:X\\to X\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S:Y\\to Y\">\\(S:Y\\to Y\\)</span> (measure-preserving maps)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\\)</span> (measure-space predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurePreservingMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurePreservingMap}_S\\)</span> (measure-preserving predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbProductSigmaAlgebra}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbProductSigmaAlgebra}_S\\)</span> (product-sigma-algebra predicate).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8JoiningMeasure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8JoiningMeasure}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure8\\text{-}joining\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8JoiningMeasure}_S(\\lambda,\\mu,\\nu,T,S;X,\\mathcal A,Y,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\land\\mu(X)=1\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu)\\land\\nu(Y)=1\\land\\exists\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X\\times Y)\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{ZfcProbProductSigmaAlgebra}_S(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,X,Y)\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X\\times Y,\\mathcal C,\\lambda)\\land\\lambda(X\\times Y)=1\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurePreservingMap}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,T)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurePreservingMap}_S(Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu,Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu,S)\\land\\forall A_0\\in\\mathcal A\\;(\\lambda(A_0\\times Y)=\\mu(A_0))\\land\\forall B_0\\in\\mathcal B\\;(\\lambda(X\\times B_0)=\\nu(B_0))\\land\\forall C_0\\in\\mathcal C\\;\\Bigl(\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in X\\times Y:\\langle T(x),S(y)\\rangle\\in C_0\\}\\in\\mathcal C\\land\\lambda(\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in X\\times Y:\\langle T(x),S(y)\\rangle\\in C_0\\})=\\lambda(C_0)\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure8\\text{-}joining\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8JoiningMeasure}_S(\\lambda,\\mu,\\nu,T,S;X,\\mathcal A,Y,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\land\\mu(X)=1\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu)\\land\\nu(Y)=1\\land\\exists\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X\\times Y)\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{ZfcProbProductSigmaAlgebra}_S(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,X,Y)\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X\\times Y,\\mathcal C,\\lambda)\\land\\lambda(X\\times Y)=1\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurePreservingMap}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,T)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurePreservingMap}_S(Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu,Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu,S)\\land\\forall A_0\\in\\mathcal A\\;(\\lambda(A_0\\times Y)=\\mu(A_0))\\land\\forall B_0\\in\\mathcal B\\;(\\lambda(X\\times B_0)=\\nu(B_0))\\land\\forall C_0\\in\\mathcal C\\;\\Bigl(\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in X\\times Y:\\langle T(x),S(y)\\rangle\\in C_0\\}\\in\\mathcal C\\land\\lambda(\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in X\\times Y:\\langle T(x),S(y)\\rangle\\in C_0\\})=\\lambda(C_0)\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Marginals and product-action invariance are expanded as measurable-set equations, so no undeclared projection or pushforward operators remain.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-joining","status":"resolved","id":"4a3373ca17fc93e6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-joining]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measure-space","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-measure-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-measure5-measure-preserving-map","status":"resolved","id":"e3a691aa8eb9a794","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-measure5-measure-preserving-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-prob-product-sigma-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"8c2a1f4e68d8efc8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-prob-product-sigma-algebra]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal P(Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu,\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"X\\times Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"T:X\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"S:Y\\to Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurePreservingMap}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProbProductSigmaAlgebra}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8JoiningMeasure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure8\\text{-}joining\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8JoiningMeasure}_S(\\lambda,\\mu,\\nu,T,S;X,\\mathcal A,Y,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\land\\mu(X)=1\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu)\\land\\nu(Y)=1\\land\\exists\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X\\times Y)\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{ZfcProbProductSigmaAlgebra}_S(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,X,Y)\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X\\times Y,\\mathcal C,\\lambda)\\land\\lambda(X\\times Y)=1\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurePreservingMap}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,T)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurePreservingMap}_S(Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu,Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu,S)\\land\\forall A_0\\in\\mathcal A\\;(\\lambda(A_0\\times Y)=\\mu(A_0))\\land\\forall B_0\\in\\mathcal B\\;(\\lambda(X\\times B_0)=\\nu(B_0))\\land\\forall C_0\\in\\mathcal C\\;\\Bigl(\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in X\\times Y:\\langle T(x),S(y)\\rangle\\in C_0\\}\\in\\mathcal C\\land\\lambda(\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in X\\times Y:\\langle T(x),S(y)\\rangle\\in C_0\\})=\\lambda(C_0)\\Bigr)\\Bigr]","display":true}],"bytes":2302,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2652","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-measure8-joining-measure.md|58-df-zfc-measure8-joining-measure]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","4a3373ca17fc93e6","83a15c7e9b3817dc","e3a691aa8eb9a794","8c2a1f4e68d8efc8"]}